      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it would be interesting to enhance the avatar name display in the same way you mentioned for world name. ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1237-display-full-world-name-in-tooltip-on-hover )\nOf course, I think it is important to wrap or make bar shorter, but I thought that might not be enough because of the problem of simply not being able to identify the avatars, as mentioned here on Canny. ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1236-see-the-full-avatar-name-at-a-glance )\nHowever, note that there may be display problems if the name is too long.\nDoing so will certainly make it more readable than it is now, but there must be a maximum length to display.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
